32
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Decisive Battle</font>

33
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">on</font>

34
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the</font>

35
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Bridge!</font>

36
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Zabuza Returns!!</font>

37
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good morning!</font>

38
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:18,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

39
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

40
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto didn't come back
last night, either?</font>

41
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's such a fool,</font>

42
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's been out every night,
climbing trees.</font>

43
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might be dead already
from using up too much Chakra.</font>

44
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Naruto-kun's okay.</font>

45
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:43,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think a child's out in
the middle of the night.</font>

46
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you don't need to worry.</font>

47
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although he may not seem to be,
he's a full-fledged Ninja.</font>

48
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:50,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder...</font>

49
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot's probably
all pooped out right about now.</font>

50
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?</font>

51
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going for a walk.</font>

52
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're about to eat...</font>

53
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was fast!</font>

54
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll catch a cold if
you keep sleeping here.</font>

55
00:04:50,220 --> 00:04:51,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?</font>

56
00:04:54,600 --> 00:05:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... Did you wake me up, nee-chan?
I mean, what're you doing here?</font>

57
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gathering medicinal herbs.</font>

58
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Herbs?</font>

59
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. For healing injuries,
sickness and the like.</font>

60
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got a lot to do early
in the morning, nee-chan...</font>

61
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:20,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too.</font>

62
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What've you been doing
in a place like this so early?</font>

63
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training!</font>

64
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that...
you're a Ninja or something?</font>

65
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What with that headband and...</font>

66
00:05:36,730 --> 00:05:38,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what I look like? Is it?</font>

67
00:05:39,110 --> 00:05:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup! I'm a Ninja!</font>

68
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding.
You're great, aren't you.</font>

69
00:05:47,990 --> 00:05:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... why are you training?</font>

70
00:05:51,990 --> 00:05:54,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me,
I want to get stronger!</font>

71
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:58,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, you already look
strong enough.</font>

72
00:05:58,790 --> 00:06:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no! I want to get
even stronger!</font>

73
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What for?</font>

74
00:06:07,170 --> 00:06:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To become the best Ninja
in my village!</font>

75
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get everyone
to recognize my strength!</font>

76
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I have to prove something
to a certain person!</font>

77
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that for the sake of somebody?
Or is it for your own sake?</font>

78
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

79
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?!</font>

80
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have somebody
precious in your life?</font>

81
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Precious...?</font>

82
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it you want to say, nee-chan?</font>

83
00:08:20,730 --> 00:08:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

84
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a person has something
precious they want to protect...</font>

85
00:08:27,690 --> 00:08:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's when they can truly
become strong.</font>

86
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:39,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your dad loves the town
you're from, so...</font>

87
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:43,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely won't allow
my comrades to get killed!</font>

88
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get your hands off Iruka-sensei!</font>

89
00:08:49,710 --> 00:08:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you!!</font>

90
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I know that well, too!</font>

91
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll get strong.</font>

92
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

93
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope we meet again somewhere.</font>

94
00:09:08,190 --> 00:09:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... and...</font>

95
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a man!</font>

96
00:09:14,070 --> 00:09:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't be!
He's cuter than Sakura-chan.</font>

97
00:09:46,690 --> 00:09:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? That's strange.</font>

98
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This world is full of mystery...</font>

99
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch.
Hey! What're you doing?!</font>

100
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you forget about mealtime,
you idiot?</font>

101
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?</font>

102
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is Naruto doing?</font>

103
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Sasuke-kun hasn't come back
from his walk either...</font>

104
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...
Naruto can climb that high now?</font>

105
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!</font>

106
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How 'bout that, how 'bout that?!</font>

107
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me,
I can climb this high now!</font>

108
00:10:37,490 --> 00:10:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa!</font>

109
00:10:39,990 --> 00:10:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you idiot!</font>

110
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

111
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha!</font>

112
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fell for it, you fell for it!</font>

113
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't scare us like that!</font>

114
00:10:57,920 --> 00:11:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill him later! Shannaro!</font>

115
00:11:01,430 --> 00:11:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's grown a little, eh.</font>

116
00:11:07,890 --> 00:11:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! You idiot, Naruto!</font>

117
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's cuz you went overboard!</font>

118
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool.</font>

119
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...?</font>

120
00:11:26,620 --> 00:11:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice, Sasuke-kun.
You're awesome!</font>

121
00:11:30,290 --> 00:11:33,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These kids are really growing.</font>

122
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki...</font>

123
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, eh.</font>

124
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've recovered considerably.</font>

125
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

126
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more, Haku.</font>

127
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

128
00:12:24,090 --> 00:12:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go back?</font>

129
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

130
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:33,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're late.</font>

131
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And not just Naruto,
but even Sasuke-kun too.</font>

132
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to you guys?</font>

133
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really muddy
and really wiped out.</font>

134
00:12:46,530 --> 00:12:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We both... climbed up to the top.</font>

135
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:51,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good.</font>

136
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Sasuke, you'll also start guarding
Tazuna-san next time!</font>

137
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it! Whoa!</font>

138
00:13:01,170 --> 00:13:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

139
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In just a teeny little bit,
the bridge will be complete.</font>

140
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's thanks to you guys.</font>

141
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, don't let your guard down...</font>

142
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've really wanted to ask
you for a long time now...</font>

143
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:23,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why are you still here
even though I lied about the mission?</font>

144
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:29,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To see what is right without doing it
bespeaks an absence of courage.</font>

145
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like master, like man.</font>

146
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a teaching of the late Hokage.</font>

147
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The things I truly
hold dear to myself...</font>

148
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect until the very end
with both these arms.</font>

149
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't cry... Inari.</font>

150
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

151
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:30,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

152
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:35,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you desperately work so hard
until you get like that?!</font>

153
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you'd be
a match for Gato's men even if you train!</font>

154
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what cool things you say
or how much effort you make...</font>

155
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:45,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the weak always lose out...</font>

156
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against the truly strong!</font>

157
00:14:54,370 --> 00:14:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up. I'm not like you.</font>

158
00:14:58,540 --> 00:15:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!
Looking at you makes me sick!</font>

159
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sticking your nose in even though
you know nothing of this land!</font>

160
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not like you who's always
acting frivolous</font>

161
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not knowing one thing about pain!</font>

162
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're just gonna cry
all day like the lead in a tragedy?</font>

163
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An idiot like you can just cry forever!
You crybaby!</font>

164
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! That's a bit harsh!</font>

165
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

166
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got a minute?</font>

167
00:16:04,770 --> 00:16:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto didn't mean any harm
with what he said...</font>

168
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just uncouth, so...</font>

169
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We heard the story
about your father from Tazuna-san.</font>

170
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like you, Naruto never had
a father as a young child...</font>

171
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually he doesn't know either
of his parents.</font>

172
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that.
He didn't have a single friend.</font>

173
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

174
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

175
00:16:34,090 --> 00:16:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen him sulk,
be timid, or cry.</font>

176
00:16:38,930 --> 00:16:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's always eager,
wanting to be acknowledged by someone.</font>

177
00:16:45,230 --> 00:16:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's for the sake of that "dream,"
he always risks his life.</font>

178
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably tired of crying.</font>

179
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, he knows the true meaning
of the word strong.</font>

180
00:17:08,630 --> 00:17:10,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like your father.</font>

181
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto might understand your feelings
the most.</font>

182
00:17:18,050 --> 00:17:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Naruto said earlier...</font>

183
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistaking that
he's told himself that over and over again.</font>

184
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then!
I leave Naruto in your hands.</font>

185
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he's used his body
to the limit...</font>

186
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think he'll be able
to move today.</font>

187
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-san, are you feeling all right?</font>

188
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:56,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, somehow.</font>

189
00:17:56,510 --> 00:17:57,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be going!</font>

190
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?</font>

191
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't hire you guys for charity work...</font>

192
00:18:08,770 --> 00:18:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, are you listening, Zabuza?!
Hey!!</font>

193
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go... Haku?</font>

194
00:18:18,530 --> 00:18:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

195
00:18:34,630 --> 00:18:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I overslept!</font>

196
00:18:37,670 --> 00:18:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey!! Where is everyone?</font>

197
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun. Your Sensei wanted you
to rest and relax... today</font>

198
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it.</font>

199
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They left me behind.</font>

200
00:18:52,690 --> 00:18:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be back.</font>

201
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
They could've woken me up!</font>

202
00:19:14,170 --> 00:19:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell is this?!</font>

203
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is going on?
What's happened?</font>

204
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be...</font>

205
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari! Give me a hand.</font>

206
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari!?</font>

207
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be right there.</font>

208
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mist...</font>

209
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Sakura!
They're coming!</font>

210
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew he was still alive.</font>

211
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Making an appearance so soon, eh...</font>

212
00:20:05,470 --> 00:20:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Kakashi-sensei.</font>

213
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is his... Hidden Mist Jutsu, right?!</font>

214
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to have kept you waiting, Kakashi.</font>

215
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see you've got those brats
with you as always.</font>

216
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still trembling. Poor thing.</font>

217
00:20:37,170 --> 00:20:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm trembling with... excitement.</font>

218
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:43,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it, Sasuke.</font>

219
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see it!</font>

220
00:20:57,690 --> 00:21:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well-well. So he could
see the Water Clones, eh.</font>

221
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat's grown quite a bit.</font>

222
00:21:04,570 --> 00:21:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This means a rival has emerged, Haku.</font>

223
00:21:07,570 --> 00:21:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems.</font>

224
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

225
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

226
00:21:40,290 --> 00:21:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

227
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

228
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

229
00:21:53,890 --> 00:21:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

230
00:21:57,230 --> 00:22:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

231
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

232
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

233
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

234
00:22:10,820 --> 00:22:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

235
00:22:14,410 --> 00:22:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

236
00:22:27,380 --> 00:22:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

237
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

238
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

239
00:22:37,430 --> 00:22:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

240
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:44,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

241
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

242
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

243
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Phew, that was a close shave.</font>

244
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sorry I was late.
But Inari, you were great.</font>

245
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:03,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I was able to save your mom
thanks to your courage.</font>

246
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey, wait a minute.</font>

247
00:23:05,650 --> 00:23:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Doesn't the fact that
we were attacked mean</font>

248
00:23:07,530 --> 00:23:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">that Kakashi-sensei and
the others are in danger too?!</font>

249
00:23:10,820 --> 00:23:13,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Haku's Master Technique. Mirror of Ice Crystals."</font>

250
00:23:13,740 --> 00:23:16,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm going to kick butt once again!</font>

